msgstr ""
"Jika Anda suka, Anda dapat memasukkan struktur khusus untuk URL produk Anda "
"di sini. Misalnya, menggunakan <code> shop </ code> akan membuat tautan "
"produk Anda seperti <code>%s shop/sample-product/</ code>. Pengaturan ini "
"hanya mempengaruhi URL produk, bukan hal-hal seperti kategori produk."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-permalink-settings.php:118
#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-taxonomies.php:121
#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-taxonomies.php:229
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Default"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-permalink-settings.php:123
msgid "Shop base"
msgstr "Berbasis Toko"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-permalink-settings.php:127
msgid "Shop base with category"
msgstr "Berbasis Toko dengan Kategori"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-permalink-settings.php:133
msgid "Custom base"
msgstr "Basis khusus"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-permalink-settings.php:135
msgid ""
"Enter a custom base to use. A base must be set or WordPress will use default "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Masukkan basis kustom untuk digunakan. Dasar harus ditetapkan atau WordPress "
"akan menggunakan default sebagai gantinya."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:60
#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-post-types.php:700
msgid "Product name"
msgstr "Nama produk"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:61
msgid ""
"Give your new product a name here. This is a required field and will be what "
"your customers will see in your store."
msgstr ""
"Berikan nama untuk produk baru Anda di sini. Kolom ini wajib diisi dan akan "
"dilihat oleh pelanggan Anda."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:73
msgid "Product description"
msgstr "Produk Kategori"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:74
msgid ""
"This is your products main body of content. Here you should describe your "
"product in detail."
msgstr ""
"Ini merupakan konten utama dari produk Anda. Di sini Anda harus menjelaskan "
"rincian dari produk Anda."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:89
msgid "Choose product type"
msgstr "Pilih tipe produk"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:90
msgid ""
"Choose a type for this product. Simple is suitable for most physical goods "
"and services (we recommend setting up a simple product for now)."
msgstr ""
"Pilih tipe untuk produk ini. Tipe sederhana ini cocok untuk sebagian besar "
"produk berwujud dan jasa (kami sarankan untuk mengatur produk yang sederhana "
"sekarang)."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:91
msgid ""
"Variable is for more complex products such as t-shirts with multiple sizes."
msgstr ""
"Tipe variabel untuk produk yang lebih rumit, seperti t-shirt dengan berbagai "
"ukuran."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:92
msgid "Grouped products are for grouping several simple products into one."
msgstr ""
"Pengelompokan produk untuk mengelompokkan beberapa produk yang sederhana "
"menjadi satu."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:93
msgid "Finally, external products are for linking off-site."
msgstr ""
"Terakhir, produk eksternal untuk menghubungkan produk di luar toko Anda."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:108
msgid "Virtual products"
msgstr "Produk virtual"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:109
msgid ""
"Check the \"Virtual\" box if this is a non-physical item, for example a "
"service, which does not need shipping."
msgstr ""
"Centang kotak \"Virtual\" jika produk tidak berwujud, contohnya jasa, dimana "
"tidak memerlukan pengiriman."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:124
#: includes/admin/meta-boxes/views/html-product-data-variations.php:85
#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-products.php:41
#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-products.php:214
msgid "Downloadable products"
msgstr "Produk Download"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:125
msgid ""
"If purchasing this product gives a customer access to a downloadable file, e."
"g. software, check this box."
msgstr ""
"Centang kotak ini jika produk yang dibeli dapat diunduh oleh pelanggan, "
"misal software."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:140
msgid "Prices"
msgstr "Harga"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:141
msgid "Next you need to give your product a price."
msgstr "Selanjutnya Anda perlu memberi harga pada produk Anda."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:157
msgid ""
"Add a quick summary for your product here. This will appear on the product "
"page under the product name."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan ringkasan untuk produk Anda di sini. Akan muncul pada halaman "
"produk di bawah nama produk."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:168
msgid "Product images"
msgstr "Gambar Produk"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:169
msgid ""
"Upload or assign an image to your product here. This image will be shown in "
"your store's catalog."
msgstr ""
"Unggah atau tentukan gambar untuk produk Anda di sini. Gambar ini akan "
"ditampilkan dalam katalog toko Anda."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:180
#: includes/class-wc-post-types.php:130 includes/class-wc-post-types.php:132
#: includes/widgets/class-wc-widget-product-tag-cloud.php:29
msgid "Product tags"
msgstr "Tag Produk"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:181
msgid ""
"You can optionally \"tag\" your products here. Tags are a method of labeling "
"your products to make them easier for customers to find."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat memilih \"memberi tag\" produk Anda di sini. Tag adalah metode "
"pelabelan produk Anda agar lebih mudah bagi pelanggan untuk menemukannya."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:192
#: includes/admin/meta-boxes/class-wc-meta-box-coupon-data.php:227
#: includes/class-wc-post-types.php:92
#: includes/widgets/class-wc-widget-product-categories.php:43
msgid "Product categories"
msgstr "Kategori Produk"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:193
msgid ""
"Optionally assign categories to your products to make them easier to browse "
"through and find in your store."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai pilihan dalam menetapkan kategori untuk produk Anda agar mudah "
"ditelusuri dan dicari dalam toko Anda."

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:204
msgid "Publish your product!"
msgstr "Publikasikan produk Anda!"

#: includes/admin/class-wc-admin-pointers.php:205
msgid ""
"When you are finished editing your product, hit the \"Publish\" button to "
"publish your product to your store."
msgstr ""
"Setelah Anda selesai menyunting produk Anda, tekan tombol \"Terbitkan\" "
"untuk menerbitkan produk Anda."

