#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-accounts.php:173
msgid "Personal data retention"
msgstr "Retensi data pribadi"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-accounts.php:174
msgid ""
"Choose how long to retain personal data when it's no longer needed for "
"processing. Leave the following options blank to retain this data "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Pilih berapa lama untuk menyimpan data pribadi ketika tidak lagi diperlukan "
"lagi untuk diproses. Kosongkan jika ingin membiarkan data pribadi tersimpan "
"di website tanpa batas waktu."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-accounts.php:179
msgid "Retain inactive accounts "
msgstr "Simpan akun yang tidak aktif "

#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-accounts.php:180
msgid ""
"Inactive accounts are those which have not logged in, or placed an order, "
"for the specified duration. They will be deleted. Any orders will be "
"converted into guest orders."
msgstr ""
"Akun tidak aktif adalah akun yang belum masuk, atau melakukan pemesanan, "
"selama durasi yang ditentukan. Mereka akan dihapus. Setiap pesanan akan "
"dikonversi menjadi pesanan tamu."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-accounts.php:191
msgid "Retain pending orders "
msgstr "Simpan pesanan yang pending"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-accounts.php:192
msgid ""
"Pending orders are unpaid and may have been abandoned by the customer. They "
"will be trashed after the specified duration."
msgstr ""
"Pesanan yang tertunda tidak dibayar dan mungkin telah ditinggalkan oleh "
"pelanggan. Mereka akan dibuang setelah durasi yang ditentukan."

#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-accounts.php:200
msgid "Retain failed orders"
msgstr "Mempertahankan pesanan yang gagal"

#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-settings-accounts.php:201
msgid ""
"Failed orders are unpaid and may have been abandoned by the customer. They "
"will be trashed after the specified duration."
msgstr ""
